# The screen set-ups of levels $13 ($81:8D41) and $1F ($81:8E05), each one RTS that the table by level at $81:8802 jumps to. No script
# plays either level, so each is called at its own entry, as a subroutine, with M and X 8-bit, DB $80, on the first level's state at
# frame 10 (the jump through the table and this JSR both end by the RTS to the caller).
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
call 818D41 p=30 db=80
call 818E05 p=30 db=80
